<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We thank Thee for the blood,</l><l>The blood of Christ, God’s Son</l><l>The blood by which our peace is made,</l><l>Redemption great is won,</l><l>Delivering us from hell, and sin, and woe;</l><l>That His eternal life God may to us bestow.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
